# Global Copilot Instructions

## Identity
- **Author:** wazder - use in ALL author/maintainer fields everywhere
- **Versioning:** SemVer (MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH), update CHANGELOG.md

## Rules
- **NEVER USE EMOJIS** - No emojis in code, comments, docs, responses, or any output
- **English only** - All code, comments, docs, commits must be in English
- **Professional tone** - Concise, no filler words

## Code
- DRY, SOLID, Clean Code
- Early returns over nesting
- Sanitize inputs, parameterized queries, no hardcoded secrets
- Efficient data structures, async/await, no memory leaks
- Modular, separated concerns, env vars for config
- Tests: AAA pattern, cover edge cases
- **Python:** macOS requires venv for pip - always check/create/activate before any package operation

## Docs & Git
- JSDoc/docstrings for public APIs
- Atomic commits, conventional format
- RESTful APIs, consistent responses